  "prefLabel": "En 1012.07 Extended Group Study Election",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.07 Extended Group Study Election.\n\n(a) The utility shall provide the applicant with an extended group study consent form within 12 business days of completion of the scoping meeting.\n\n(b) The applicant shall provide an executed extended group study consent form within 10 business days of receiving the consent form from the utility.\n\n(c) The applicant shall be eligible for an extended group study if all remaining facilities in the group submit an executed extended group study consent form to the utility.\n\n(d) If the applicant is deemed eligible for an extended group study, the utility shall produce a non-binding estimate for the cost of system modifications.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
}
